window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A magical object might have stolen Jas’ power, but it can’t keep her from reclaiming it. </p> <p>Jas is no stranger to trouble. She usually sets off in search of it, for funsies. </p> <p>Not anymore. </p> <p>Not now that her cursed pendant has delivered her to the last place she’d ever wish to go. </p> <p>To the one place where she definitely doesn’t belong. </p> <p>She wants nothing more than to return to the Magical Creatures Academy to squirrel away some private time with the smoking hot shifter who’s finally all hers. </p> <p>But first, she’ll have to find her way out of an alternate dimension, where creatures go and never leave. And to do that, she’ll have to master the necklace of power that no one has ever outwitted before. </p>"; 
